<title>USA: Natl Home Health to buy 3 agencies.</title>
<headline>Natl Home Health to buy 3 agencies.</headline>
<dateline>SCARSDALE, N.Y. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Home Health Care Corp said Thursday that it has entered into a non-binding letter of intent to acquire three affiliated licensed home health care agencies located in the states of New York, New Jersey and Maryland.</p>
<p>The three target companies have combined annual revenues of about $8 million.</p>
<p>National Home said it expects the acquisition to be completed by December 1997.</p>
